# Retail Sales Performance Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project analyzes Global Superstore sales data using Microsoft Excel and provides business insights through interactive visualizations.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Slicers

## Dashboard Features
- Yearly Sales Trend Analysis
- Top 10 Products Analysis
- Category Distribution
- Region-wise Sales Analysis
- Sales vs Profit Comparison
- Interactive Filters using Slicers

## Dataset
Global Superstore Dataset

